			],
			"Message": "fix(Wind): Correct optional field handling and type safety across services\n\nUpdate generated catalog versions to 2026-06-11. Fix optional property spreading in WorkbenchNotificationService and WorkbenchProgressService to only include defined values, preventing undefined from being sent to upstream. Resolve type errors in Workspaces event payload extraction, FileSystem IStat re-export, globalThis property access in ResolveConfiguration, Tauri IPC args typing, MistWebSocketTransport backoff array access, and TauriMainProcessService TierIPC lookup. Move fileSystemProviderService lookup outside registration loop in WorkbenchIntegration. Remove unused fileTypeToString and Install exports.\n\nImpact: Eliminates TypeScript errors, ensures proper optional field semantics for upstream compatibility, and improves code correctness across the Wind service layer.",
			"SHA": "2eb0d8a78c566a51b31621d28c3a3aed963f7ba3"
