			"Message": "build(Wind): Regenerate upstream service interfaces and complete bridge shape generation\n\nRestore 150+ generated service interface files under Source/Effect/Generated/ from VS Code upstream sources, adding CommandCatalog.ts with 551 command registrations and ServiceCatalog.ts with 516 service decorator entries. Reformat all ESBuild configuration files (BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig, Wind.js, Target.js, index.js, and constants) to expanded multi-line format for readability. Add 15 Workbench*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts bridge shape files mapping upstream service interfaces to Wind's __CEL_SERVICES__ global registry, plus UserSettingsBridgeShapeGenerated.ts for configuration service bridging.\n\nImpact: Completes the codegen pipeline established in prior commits, aligns all upstream service definitions with current VS Code sources, and provides full bridge shape coverage for Wind workbench services.",
